        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-4718, Fancy Ribbed Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's PH-4718 Fancy Ribbed Door Handle has a 13 inch overall length and a 12 inch center to center. This ribbed door pull has a traditional design that goes beyond the plain and into the glamorous. It is the little details that make something look expensive, and the ridges on this handle serve to catch the highlights of the 5 available finishes. The Traditional Fancy Door Pull is easy to install with the included hardware pack. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-drop-pull-rk-international-cp-3721\"><b>Fancy Ridged Drop Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-3718\"><b>Fancy Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-ridged-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-9308\"><b>Fancy Ridged Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the PH-4718 Fancy Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/4\"\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
